    <briefdescription>
<para>Computes the quality of a cell for a predator based on prey biomass and edibility. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class uses the <ref refid="class_edibility_value" kindref="compound">EdibilityValue</ref> object to assess how valuable the resources in a cell are for a predator, taking into account the proximity and biomass of prey. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
